notes: The owner explicitly requested V031 while V030 had not been separately accepted, so V030 is the previous candidate and V024 / 0_2_4 remains the owner-confirmed passed baseline. V031 preserves all seven V030 network comparison modes and their protected timing behavior while adding schema-versioned persistent normalized decision evidence. Scenario, cooperation, pedestrian-awareness, vehicle-class, emergency-priority and emergency-lifecycle histories are projected into one compact ledger with deterministic evidence IDs, action/decision/reason, timing before/after, relevant context, provenance, concise explanations and source references. New JSON/CSV evidence endpoints can also project the schema on demand for older stored network runs without rewriting them. Physical/public-road traffic control remains disabled.
